          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "সৃষ্টি করা — srishṭi kôrā — \"to create; to give rise to\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "নতুন নিয়মটা অনেক ঝামেলা সৃষ্টি করল। nôtun niyômṭā ônek jhāmelā srishṭi kôrlô. The new rule caused a lot of trouble."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (he/she …): তিনি একটা নতুন দল সৃষ্টি করলেন, tini ekṭā nôtun dôl srishṭi kôrlen."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "সৃষ্টি করা (srishṭi kôrā) is Sanskrit sṛṣṭi, creation or bringing forth (Monier-Williams), with করা 'to do'. It can make something good (a new team) or something unwelcome (trouble)."
            }
          ]
        },
